{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25517","headline":"至日荷李常侍过郊居 · 熊孺登","name":"至日荷李常侍过郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贱子守柴荆，谁人记姓名。\n风云千骑降，草木一阳生。\n礼异江河动，欢殊里巷惊。\n称觞容侍坐，看竹许同行。\n遇觉沧溟浅，恩疑太岳轻。\n尽搜天地物，无谕此时情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊孺登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}